    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="T85n2863-start">
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">But Buddhism and Daoism speak of the selfless suffering and emptiness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Knowing beforehand the meagerness of blessings and karmic connections,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Understanding fully the consequences that follow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">I have compiled and written exhortations on encouraging good and admonishing against transgressions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Though the table of contents may have few items,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">I have composed over three hundred poems.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">And they speak of current events, not empty speculation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">They discuss the value of writing by Wáng Fànzhì (王梵志),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">And learn the essentials of Dīng (丁) and Guō (郭).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Not relying on scriptures, they all present common sayings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Not only do wise scholars easily change their minds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">But even foolish men alter their countenances.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">The good news spreads far and wide, encouraging the pursuit of goodness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Greedy historians, [missing characters], plunder.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Officials who hold office without performing their duties should naturally be honest and diligent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Though each may be foolish and ignorant, their feelings are extremely sorrowful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Read it through once, search, and think thrice, never forgetting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Even if great monks preach,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">It will not be as effective as reading this virtuous text.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:33:39.053+09:00">Rebellious sons, by inquiring after their parents' well-being morning and evening, will certainly become very filial.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">All the silk baskets are filled to the brim.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Knowing about sin and blessings, diligently and earnestly cultivating provides enough food.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">With unwavering devotion, the five emotions do not change.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Both the eastern prefectures and the western districts praise them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Simply having this chapter read thoroughly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323a1801.s31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Even the stubborn, foolish, ignorant, and stupid will all become virtuous and good.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Look afar at the people in the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Villages, hamlets, peaceful communities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">One family experiences death and birth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">The whole village gathers to weep together.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Opening their mouths, they wail over the corpse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Not knowing that their own departure is imminent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">They are essentially long-sleeping ghosts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Temporarily standing on the earth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Desiring to be like a felt cloth for raising children,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Alternately drying and then becoming wet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Those who died before are buried deeply.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0201.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Those who die after are soon added.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">When I was wealthy and had money,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">My wife and children treated me well.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">If I took off my clothes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">They would fold my robes and padded jackets for me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">When I went out on business,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">They would see me off onto the road.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Bringing [wealth?] into the house,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">They would smile at me with a full face.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Circling around me like white doves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">Cherishing me like a parrot.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">If I encounter temporary poverty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:34:20.682+09:00">They immediately give me scornful looks.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">People have seven times of poverty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Seven times of wealth and four phases of retribution.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Following wealth and disregarding others.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b0601.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Just look at the path they took.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1101.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">The family all die.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1101.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">When I die, there are no relatives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1101.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Anxiously buying property.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1101.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">And setting up a pre-mortem repentance ritual.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1101.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Hoping to be reborn in a good place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1101.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">When I die, hire someone to bury me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1101.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">The neighbors and relatives pay for the money.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1101.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Letting you handle the difference.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">The body is like a sheep in a pen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Life's retribution is pitiful and fitting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Sheep are covered in wool and run around.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">People wear good clothes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">But stripping off the clothes and standing naked.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Then the pretense is not as good as a sheep.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Sheep die every day.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">People also die every day.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">From head to tail, being caught and taken away.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">It is still the same as a fat, good sheep.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Sheep die hard.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">When people leave, there are no obvious wounds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">When life ends, they follow him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">The soul travels to another land.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">If you have money, do more good deeds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Eat well and wear good clothes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Foolish people widely create sins.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b1401.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">The wise should consider this well.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Laughable are the people of this world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">There are many fools and few clever people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Not worrying about the long road to death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Greedily clinging to bitter troubles.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">At night, wandering in the realm of ghosts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">At dawn, returning to the path of humans.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Suddenly arising, being dragged by *xiāng luó*, chirping and demanding ancestral atonement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Poverty and suffering have nowhere to come from.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">Connecting to the whipping and beating over there.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T85n2863_CBETA_001-1323b2001.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-30T18:35:29.145+09:00">In life, there is suffering and pain.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
